##  Monetize Dashboard

### Objective
The Monetize dashboard focuses on understanding how effectively the Mavin Toy Store generates revenue from its website activity and customer purchases.

### What I Analyzed
- Total revenue generated
- Revenue trends over time
- Number of orders
- Customer purchasing activity
- The relationship between website activity and revenue generation
- Revenue performance across different periods

### Key Insights
The dashboard shows how website activity translates into actual business value through purchases and revenue. Analyzing revenue alongside orders and traffic helps identify periods of stronger monetization and areas where the business may have opportunities to generate more value from existing visitors.

### Business Impact
Generating website traffic is only one part of e-commerce success. The business must also convert that traffic into purchases and revenue. Monitoring monetization performance helps determine whether the store is effectively turning customer activity into financial results.

### Recommendation
The business should focus on increasing revenue from existing traffic by improving the customer journey, encouraging repeat purchases, promoting high-performing products, and identifying opportunities to increase order value.
